  <summary>Hardware Sync plugin for OpenRGB to display hardware measurements on RGB devices</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      The OpenRGB Hardware Sync plugin is an addon for OpenRGB that allows you to display hardware
      measurements such as component temperatures, CPU/GPU usage, RAM/VRAM usage, and more on your
      OpenRGB-supported RGB devices.  Create a gradient to map to a measurement range and then
      assign it to one or more device zones.  Supports varying color based on measurement or
      producing a line graph on a linear or matrix device.
    </p><p>
      Features
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>View your hardware statistics on your RGB devices</li>
      <li>Supports multiple measurements at once</li>
      <li>View as either a single color or as a line graph</li>
      <li>Save measurements to OpenRGB profiles</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

